node_modules
web/dist/
.DS_Store
*.log
# The projects are this machine's own (made with the guide in the app): roles,
# notes, people, logos. Only the description and the local config's shape are shared.
teams/*
!teams/README.md
!teams/team.local.example.json
# Portraits are made per project and role.
web/public/avatars/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
# Worktrees for Gudfadern conversations in the control room itself.
.claude/worktrees/
# Agents taken off a team; kept so they can be brought back.
teams/*/roles/.removed/
# Meshy's raw downloads (several hundred MB): kept on this Mac, since Meshy deletes them after three days.
# The compressed copies in web/public are what the app uses.
library/characters/**/*.glb
library/office/*.glb
library/accessories/*.glb
# Secrets never go in git, here or anywhere: keys live in the keychain (macOS) or DPAPI (Windows).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
